      <div type="clause" n="7">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIEg">III Eg</ref> 7</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be tyhtbysigum.] [Ld] ⁊ se þe tihtbisig sy ⁊ folc ungetrywe ⁊ þas gemot forbuge þrywa, þonne scifte man of þam gemote ða ðe him toridan, ⁊ finde þonne git borh, gif he mæge.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone who has a bad reputation and is unworthy of public confidence fails to attend the court-meetings three times, men shall be chosen from the meetings who shall ride to him, and may then still find a surety, if he can.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se ðe tihtbysig sý ⁊ folce ungetriwe ⁊ þas gemot forbuge, þonne sceawie man of ðam gemote þa þe him toridan, ⁊ finde him þonne gyt borh, gyf he mæge.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
